# Runtime dependencies for the inference container.
#
# Deliberately small. Every package here is loaded into every inference pod and
# has to be patched on the serving path, so anything that is only needed to
# train a model belongs in training.in instead.
#
# Compile with:  make lock
# That regenerates serving.txt with pinned versions and hashes.

